{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d1e9bba6314398404adc856c0a1bea169d1ab76dd6454e997ae91f5cdedf9a80", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日だ。\nのり子は犬がテーマの衣装で撮影をするのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是cosplay写真企划的拍摄日。\n法子要穿狗狗主题的服装拍摄，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "7d8e3dcef57213894cea52a226a27d92c41fb5ef14ec54e456842d5fb58632cb", "ja": "うー……いやガマンガマン！\nもうすぐ撮影も始まるんだし！", "zh": "呜……不行，要忍住忍住！\n拍摄马上就要开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50c9586cfa2dc0892d349b394f9410c66a2e4402d3b4caa518041221ae167cf4", "ja": "のり子？　どうした？\n気になることがあるなら話聞くけど。", "zh": "诺莉子？怎么了？\n如果有什么在意的事，我可以听你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "918d5f7dcf3e0d0d6ae91f969616ab55da3d5203e677e6627ee4e92946e79f7d", "ja": "{$P$}……。えっと、\n今さらなに言ってんだって感じなんだけどさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……那个，\n虽然现在才说这个好像有点晚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f55aee15995bcc45fbebb07248189210c4bda9fec85d94e2f2f06414f848c45", "ja": "この衣装、アタシが着るには\nちょっと可愛すぎじゃないかなっ！？", "zh": "这套服装对我来说，是不是有点太可爱了呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1005_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "6be0ea7729d34f1d3d40b39a7583350ef58e7b93dc1ba497354d989627c253c6", "ja": "この衣装にした考えがあるんだろうけど。でも！\nでもさ！　着替えが終わって、鏡を見たら……うう。", "zh": "你选择这套服装肯定有你的想法。不过！\n可是啊！换好衣服照镜子一看……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1007_p", "source_sha256": "902d065d77de0b6ba4faf722d455af1850db278a4a2c23b22df5b8399d7c1b2d", "ja": "……急に恥ずかしくなった？", "zh": "……突然觉得害羞了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e8f88d55582f1b712f54d99de7025263569ecd61b2976e84f19c9e1a2bd71ff", "ja": "うん……。可愛い衣装なんだけど、\nいつもと方向性が違うじゃない？　こう、なんか……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然衣服很可爱，\n但跟平时不是一个风格吧？就感觉，怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "03ade26a4c964c3c36f1a4c198867899e3a4d5ad8a0f31df182fd8e99e07ef56", "ja": "話してたら、もっと恥ずかしくなってきちゃったよ。\n{$P$}、あんま見ないでーっ！", "zh": "说着说着，我反而更害羞了。{$P$}，别一直盯着我看——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1010_p", "source_sha256": "59b2ad47032823cbc85584b73edf01f8cb731ec93d0b4c910b8019fdba7c9ead", "ja": "（……困ったな。これじゃ撮影に入れない。\nこんな時は……！）", "zh": "（……这下麻烦了，没法开始拍摄。遇到这种时候……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_1011", "source_sha256": "35f460e3eeb4f885b5944c08d2a148aa3c5dafe6370ab894cac38c623794f84e", "ja": "プロレス！", "zh": "职业摔跤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bfe959415e54884496f52179901e3eebd2f7ff2ff5f6cc2ba7fd4151bf7ee21f", "ja": "そうだ！　のり子、こんな話を知ってるか？\n実は犬もプロレスをするらしい。", "zh": "对了！你知道吗，诺丽子，听说狗狗其实也会摔跤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2001_043nor", "source_sha256": "565617c89bc0d47c63acef6d27404ed5dd04b18a172221612685ddac33f29bc3", "ja": "えっ……プロレス？　犬が？", "zh": "咦……摔跤？狗也会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a19c5334f48cd7568fdc715a451c4179c8c0de6b3c4aa5ec7cc506ded40b4f30", "ja": "まぁ、厳密にはスキンシップ的なじゃれ合いのことを\n言うみたいだ。犬同士のコミュニケーションだな。", "zh": "嗯……严格来说，指的是类似肢体接触的嬉闹吧。算是狗狗之间的交流。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2003_043nor", "source_sha256": "942ece5a38eec635922d28a85d0733934bf74a235677059928c766bfcb975453", "ja": "へー、そうなんだ！　面白いね。\nじゃあ、犬の世界にもチャンピオンがいるのかな？", "zh": "哦——原来是这样！真有意思。\n那么，狗狗的世界里也有冠军吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2004_p", "source_sha256": "b4becd031b1de58eb408a6ce5f2989f75c493206a43ac072be62b35cfab6dc90", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。\nなら今日のチャンピオンはのり子、君だ！", "zh": "也许是吧。\n那么，今天的冠军就是你，诺莉子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2005_043nor", "source_sha256": "059e6de0583e978ca95aac7497a21756178ef74fe63054025856e15bfc4e745f", "ja": "……！　アタシが、チャンピオン……！", "zh": "……！我是，冠军……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2006_043nor", "source_sha256": "6e95bc1c9b6c2f0d6f33e3d178f197c49fc1430b2a827619552b16bb9ab23017", "ja": "へへっ♪　それなら、堂々としてないと\n逆に恥ずかしいよね。よーし、気合い入れるぞ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 既然这样，就得表现得堂堂正正的，不然反而会觉得害羞呢。好——打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0483_2007_p", "source_sha256": "efc658303fc81db0ce87b8ead700b7bc178ed1d0f9ec6a1e7e49367845fbed6c", "ja": "（たまに恥ずかしがるような素振りもみえたが、\n無事、撮影は終了。可愛らしい一枚になったな！）", "zh": "（虽然偶尔也能看出她害羞的样子，\n不过拍摄顺利结束了。拍出了一张很可爱的照片啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
